2145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (competitiveness. A simpler tax system, with lower costs of compliance, may also attract foreign direct investment. Multinational companies can contribute to employment, economic growth and exports. A flat tax may also reduce tax evasion, as long as it is not set too high. It will reduce tax loopholes and make it less likely that mistakes will be made in completing and assessing tax forms. If more revenue is raised, the government could spend more on, for instance, education and health care. Such spending can increase labour productivity, international competitiveness and economic growth. A flat tax, however, does not redistribute income and wealth. In the absence of allowances and exceptions, it may also be inequitable. For instance, a single sales tax of 15% would fall more heavily on the poor as it would take a larger proportion of their income. A flat tax has the potential to increase efficiency and increase tax revenue and economic growth but there are equity issues.)
/E (competitiveness. A simpler tax system, with lower costs of compliance, may also attract foreign direct investment. Multinational companies can contribute to employment, economic growth and exports. A flat tax may also reduce tax evasion, as long as it is not set too high. It will reduce tax loopholes and make it less likely that mistakes will be made in completing and assessing tax forms. If more revenue is raised, the government could spend more on, for instance, education and health care. Such spending can increase labour productivity, international competitiveness and economic growth. A flat tax, however, does not redistribute income and wealth. In the absence of allowances and exceptions, it may also be inequitable. For instance, a single sales tax of 15% would fall more heavily on the poor as it would take a larger proportion of their income. A flat tax has the potential to increase efficiency and increase tax revenue and economic growth but there are equity issues.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
